Description: Extends 'DescToolsX' with a coherent collection of classical,
    robust, nonparametric, and specialized hypothesis tests, confidence
    intervals, and probability distributions. Consistent interfaces and
    carefully documented implementations make advanced statistical methods
    readily accessible in everyday R workflows.
